gBT(){return"Patient data is sensitive data. For that reason, everything uploaded to the cloud (records, surgeries and settings) is encrypted ON YOUR DEVICE with AES-256 before being sent; only encrypted data is stored on the server. Data is also always kept on your device, so the app works offline. Cloud sync requires signing in."},
