gFT(){return"Your prescription is created from scratch: fill in the letterhead details (name, titles, registration number and footers); each field has its own size, color and style. The prescription fields (patient, title, body, signature and date) go in fixed positions on the A5 sheet and use the general style. The preview shows the result; the signature is done by hand on the printed paper."},
gFS(){return"Background image (optional): an image used as a watermark for the prescription \u2014 for example a logo. It sits between the line separating the doctor\u2019s titles and the line separating the footer, behind the text and faded."},
